## VAL YAML Schema (minimum required fields)

```yaml
# -- VAL-LEO-AI-<NNN> -- <Short title>
# IEC 62304 Validation Test Protocol

- id: "VAL-LEO-AI-<NNN>"
  version: "1.0"
  status: "draft"   # draft -> passed after execution

  traceability:
    user_needs: []             # UN-LEO-AI-* IDs
    design_inputs: ["DI-LEO-AI-<NNN>"]
    risks: []                  # R-LEO-AI-* IDs
    verification_tests: ["VT-LEO-AI-<NNN>"]

  metadata:
    title: "<Human-readable title>"
    description: |
      <What end-to-end behaviour or clinical outcome is being validated>
    validation_phase: "post-deployment"   # pre-deployment | post-deployment | simulated-use
    test_type: "functional"               # functional | calibration | usability | performance
    automation_level: "semi-automated"    # automated | semi-automated | manual
    participants:
      user_type: "clinical_reviewer"      # clinical_reviewer | quality_lead | end_user
      count: 1
      selection_criteria: "<Who must perform this test>"

  test_environment:
    environment_name: "staging"   # staging | production
    prerequisites:
      - "<Environment or data pre-condition>"

  acceptance_criteria:
    - criterion: "<Name>"
      target: "<Measurable threshold>"
      measurement: "<How to measure>"
      rationale: "<Clinical or safety justification>"

  user_scenarios:
    - scenario_id: "VAL-<NNN>-SCENARIO-001"
      scenario_name: "<Short name>"
      user_role: "<Role performing the scenario>"
      steps:
        - step_number: 1
          action: "<What the user does>"
          expected_result: "<What should happen>"
          success_criteria: "<Specific pass condition>"

  evidence_bundle:
    bundle_id: "VAL-<NNN>-EXEC-PLACEHOLDER"
    blob_path: "/evidence-bundles/LEO-AI/validation/VAL-LEO-AI-<NNN>/"
    immutability: true
    evidence_types:
      - "<Artefact type e.g. query output, session log>"

  execution_history: []
```

